/-! # The monotone classes of the hcap tier (generated by `hcap/py/mkmono.py` from `hcap/py/mono.py`)

For each class `c` below there is a raised superspace class `u` and a symmetry `(t, P, Q)` (prof7's group, `C3.actN`)
mapping `K_c` into `K_u`, with `u`'s `K3eD` bound at least `c`'s.  `HC.fact_transport'` then gives `ClassLB c lb` from
`ClassLB u lb` (a decomposition with fewer than `lb` terms outside `K_c` maps to one with fewer than `lb` outside `K_u`), and
`c`'s E1 statement for `HC.hcls_K3eD_final` follows (`e1Concl_of_fact`).  No enumeration is needed for these classes.

| c | lb | from | other superspace classes |
|---|---|---|---|
| 298 | 17 | 185 | - |
| 300 | 18 | 159 | 202 |
| 317 | 17 | 206 | - |
| 318 | 18 | 207 | - |
| 338 | 17 | 185 | - |
| 355 | 18 | 236 | - |
| 356 | 18 | 236 | - |
| 364 | 18 | 218 | - |
| 365 | 18 | 207 | 213, 236 |
| 369 | 18 | 213 | 236 |
| 370 | 18 | 207 | 212, 218 |
| 371 | 18 | 236 | 237 |
| 374 | 18 | 237 | - |
| 391 | 18 | 204 | 244 |
| 418 | 19 | 284 | - |
| 421 | 19 | 303 | - |
| 423 | 19 | 303 | 321 |
| 425 | 19 | 284 | - |
| 426 | 19 | 321 | - |
| 444 | 19 | 303 | - |
